    "html": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Libre+Franklin:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');\n  :root {\n    --color-sky-marker: #44b1ff;\n    --color-dust-blue: #a2d1f1;\n    --color-near-black: #1e1e1e;\n    --color-parchment: #f2efe9;\n    --color-chalk: #ffffff;\n    --color-fog: #e3e3e3;\n    --color-ash: #d4d4d4;\n    --font-libre-franklin: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;\n  }\n  .stats-wrapper {\n    background: var(--color-dust-blue);\n    padding: 32px 24px;\n    font-family: var(--font-libre-franklin);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    width: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .stats-card {\n    background: var(--color-chalk);\n    border: 1px solid var(--color-fog);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 20px 24px;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 360px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .stats-card-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .stats-card-title-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .stats-card-icon {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 16px;\n    background: var(--color-near-black);\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .stats-card-title {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    letter-spacing: -0.013em;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n  .stats-card-menu {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 3px;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .stats-card-menu span {\n    width: 4px;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: var(--color-ash);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .stats-label {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.025em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .stats-big-number {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .stats-period-card {\n    background: var(--color-parchment);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n  }\n  .stats-period-label {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    letter-spacing: -0.013em;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .stats-metrics-row {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 0;\n  }\n  .stats-metric {\n    padding-right: 16px;\n    border-right: 1px solid var(--color-fog);\n  }\n  .stats-metric:last-child {\n    border-right: none;\n    padding-right: 0;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n  }\n  .stats-metric:nth-child(2) {\n    padding-left: 16px;\n  }\n  .stats-metric-label {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.025em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--color-ash);\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .stats-metric-value {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    letter-spacing: -0.016em;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"stats-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"stats-card\">\n    <div class=\"stats-card-header\">\n      <div class=\"stats-card-title-row\">\n        <div class=\"stats-card-icon\">\n          <svg width=\"12\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 10\" fill=\"none\">\n            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"2\" width=\"12\" height=\"1.5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"white\"/>\n            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"5\" width=\"12\" height=\"1.5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"white\"/>\n            <rect x=\"0\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"1.5\" rx=\"0.5\" fill=\"white\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <span class=\"stats-card-title\">Studio Notes sign up page</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stats-card-menu\">\n        <span></span><span></span><span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stats-label\">Total Subscribers</div>\n    <div class=\"stats-big-number\">8,834</div>\n    <div class=\"stats-period-card\">\n      <div class=\"stats-period-label\">Last 90 days</div>\n      <div class=\"stats-metrics-row\">\n        <div class=\"stats-metric\">\n          <div class=\"stats-metric-label\">Visitors</div>\n          <div class=\"stats-metric-value\">24,257</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stats-metric\">\n          <div class=\"stats-metric-label\">Subscribers</div>\n          <div class=\"stats-metric-value\">3,014</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stats-metric\">\n          <div class=\"stats-metric-label\">Conversion Rate</div>\n          <div class=\"stats-metric-value\">12.47%</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Subscriber Stats Dashboard Card",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Libre+Franklin:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');\n  :root {\n    --color-sky-marker: #44b1ff;\n    --color-near-black: #1e1e1e;\n    --color-parchment: #f2efe9;\n    --color-chalk: #ffffff;\n    --color-fog: #e3e3e3;\n    --color-sage-foam: #b9e9c5;\n    --font-libre-franklin: 'Libre Franklin', sans-serif;\n  }\n  .cta-section-wrapper {\n    background: var(--color-parchment);\n    padding: 48px 32px;\n    font-family: var(--font-libre-franklin);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    width: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 0;\n  }\n  .cta-headline {\n    font-size: 48px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    letter-spacing: -0.43px;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n    font-family: var(--font-libre-franklin);\n  }\n  .cta-headline .highlight {\n    color: var(--color-sky-marker);\n  }\n  .cta-body {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    letter-spacing: -0.016em;\n    margin: 0 0 28px 0;\n    max-width: 460px;\n  }\n  .cta-body strong {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .cta-button-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .btn-primary {\n    background: var(--color-sky-marker);\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    font-family: var(--font-libre-franklin);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -0.013em;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 16px 24px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 1;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .btn-secondary {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    font-family: var(--font-libre-franklin);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -0.013em;\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-fog);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 14px 22px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 1;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .cta-fine-print {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    letter-spacing: -0.013em;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .cta-badges {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .cta-badge {\n    background: var(--color-sage-foam);\n    color: var(--color-near-black);\n    font-family: var(--font-libre-franklin);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.025em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 5px 10px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"cta-section-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"cta-badges\">\n    <span class=\"cta-badge\">14-day free trial</span>\n    <span class=\"cta-badge\">No credit card</span>\n    <span class=\"cta-badge\">Free migrations</span>\n  </div>\n  <h2 class=\"cta-headline\">Email marketing<br>that <span class=\"highlight\">automates</span><br>your growth</h2>\n  <p class=\"cta-body\">Stop juggling complex marketing tasks when you could be writing, teaching, and creating. Kit automates your email marketing so <strong>you can get back to doing what you love.</strong></p>\n  <div class=\"cta-button-row\">\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-primary\">Start free trial</a>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-secondary\">Request a demo</a>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"cta-fine-print\">14-day free trial. No credit card required. Free migrations.</p>\n</div>",
    "name": "Primary CTA Button Group with Trial Note",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "name": "Primary CTA Button",
    "role": "Main call-to-action \u2014 'Start free trial', sign-up triggers",
    "description": "Background #44b1ff, text #1e1e1, border-radius 12px, padding 16px all sides. Font: Libre Franklin 600 14-16px. No border. On parchment (#f2efe9) backgrounds this creates the single chromatic pop on an otherwise neutral surface. Appears 9\u00d7 as the dominant button variant."
  },
  {
    "name": "Ghost Navigation Button",
    "role": "Secondary nav actions like 'Log in', 'Request a demo', dropdown triggers",
    "description": "Background transparent, text #1e1e1, border-radius 0px, no padding (inline text-style). Libre Franklin 400-600 14px. Border inherited as #e3e3e3 only when grouped. Used for non-CTA nav links that need no chrome \u2014 they read as text until hovered."
  },
  {
    "name": "Subtle Tinted Button",
    "role": "Tertiary or grouped option buttons within content",
    "description": "Background oklab dark-tinted at ~8% opacity (#1e1e1 at 0.08), text #1e1e1, border-radius 8px, zero padding (tight fit). Creates a very-light pressed-surface appearance against parchment. Appears 4\u00d7 as an in-content control variant."
  },
  {
    "name": "Text Action Button",
    "role": "Inline content actions, pill-style small controls",
    "description": "Background transparent, text #1e1e1, border-radius 8px, padding 4px top/bottom \u00d7 8px left/right. Libre Franklin 400 14px. Minimal-chrome button for low-emphasis actions within content blocks."
  },
  {
    "name": "Hero Feature Card",
    "role": "Below-the-fold 4-column feature summary tiles",
    "description": "Background #ffffff on parchment page, border 1px #e3e3e3, border-radius 12px, padding 24px. Contains a colored icon (Amber Flag #f2ba41 or Sky Marker #44b1ff), Libre Franklin 700 14-16px bold feature name inline with body weight 400 description. Light card on warm page base creates subtle lift without shadows."
  },
  {
    "name": "Pastel Section Background Band",
    "role": "Full-bleed section backgrounds used to break page rhythm",
    "description": "Full-width bands using Dust Blue #a2d1f1, Blush Mist #e7c9f1, Peach Sand #ffd0ad, or Sage Foam #b9e9c5. No border, no radius (edge-to-edge). Text remains #1e1e1 throughout \u2014 contrast is always AAA (12:1+). Each band houses product screenshots or feature illustrations, never more than one pastel per consecutive section."
  },
  {
    "name": "Navigation Bar",
    "role": "Sticky top navigation across all pages",
    "description": "Background #f2efe9 (parchment), height ~56px, border-bottom 1px #e3e3e3. Left: Kit wordmark #1e1e1e. Center: ghost text nav items (Features, Pricing, Use Cases, Resources) Libre Franklin 600 14px. Right: 'Log in' ghost + 'Request a demo' ghost + 'Start free trial' #44b1ff pill button at border-radius 12px, padding 16px. Entire bar shares the parchment base \u2014 no white nav-on-white convention."
  },
  {
    "name": "Footer Column Grid",
    "role": "Site-wide footer link columns",
    "description": "Background #1e1e1 (near-black), text #ffffff for links, column headers in Libre Franklin 600 10-12px uppercase with 0.025em letter-spacing. Links in Libre Franklin 400 14px #ffffff. 4-column grid with 32px column gap. 'NEW' badge appears as a small Sage Foam #b9e9c5 pill tag inline with select links. Parchment logo (#f2efe9 tinted) in bottom-left."
  },
  {
    "name": "Testimonial / Creator Photo Strip",
    "role": "Social proof imagery along the hero's right edge",
    "description": "Circular avatar images 40-48px diameter, stacked vertically with 4px gap, border 2px #ffffff. Float against the photographic hero background. No label text \u2014 image-only stack creates ambient trust signal without disrupting the headline hierarchy."
  },
  {
    "name": "NEW Badge",
    "role": "Inline tag marking new features in nav and footer",
    "description": "Background Sage Foam #b9e9c5, text #1e1e1, border-radius 8px, padding 4px 8px. Libre Franklin 600 10px uppercase with 0.025em tracking. Appears inline after link text \u2014 not as a standalone badge but as a tight appended label."
  }
]
